+Browser private-draft cipher: @noble/ciphers 1.3.0 (MIT), bundled with esbuild 0.25.10. npm lockfile pins integrity; installation did not run package scripts. No runtime npm install is required for the software.
+
+Rebuild from this directory: `npm ci --ignore-scripts --no-audit --no-fund`, then `node_modules/.bin/esbuild entry.js --bundle --format=iife --global-name=VihanDraftCipher --platform=browser --target=es2020 --minify --outfile=../../app/vendor/vihan-draft-cipher.js`.
+
+On Windows use the platform's .cmd runner as appropriate. Preserve upstream LICENSE, never substitute weak randomness or disable authentication. The app uses random nonces, authenticated owner/key metadata, and server-authorized account keys; keys are not persisted in browser storage. Actual native Windows verification remains separate.
